  "description": "<p data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"370\">Stap in de rol van een elite-agent in <em data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"218\">Pursuit Force: Extreme Justice</em> voor de <strong data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"257\">PlayStation Portable (PSP)</strong>. Neem het op tegen gevaarlijke criminele bendes in spectaculaire achtervolgingen vol actie, explosies en stunts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"471\">Spring van rijdende voertuigen, schakel vijanden uit en herstel de orde in deze intense actietitel.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"476\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"502\">📦 Productinformatie</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"683\">\r\n<li data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"547\">\r\n<p data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"547\"><strong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"518\">Platform:</strong> PlayStation Portable (PSP)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"593\">\r\n<p data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"593\"><strong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"560\">Titel:</strong> Pursuit Force: Extreme Justice</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"625\">\r\n<p data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"625\"><strong data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"606\">Genre:</strong> Action / Shooter</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"657\">\r\n<p data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"657\"><strong data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"642\">Spelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"683\">\r\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"683\"><strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"673\">Leeftijd:</strong> PEGI 12</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"688\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"701\">✅ Staat</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"792\">\r\n<li data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"724\">\r\n<p data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"724\">Originele UMD-disc</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"740\">\r\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"740\">Goede staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"771\">\r\n<p data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"771\">Getest en volledig werkend</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"792\">\r\n<p data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"792\">Inclusief doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"844\">🚓 Waarom Pursuit Force: Extreme Justice?</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<li data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"886\">\r\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"886\">Spectaculaire voertuigachtervolgingen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<p data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"926\">Unieke gameplay met voertuigwissels</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"965\">\r\n<p data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"965\">Snelle actie en explosieve missies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1009\">\r\n<p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1009\">Perfect voor liefhebbers van actiegames</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1055\">Leuke toevoeging aan iedere PSP-collectie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
